  "**Abirami:** paid Rs 61,020 for a two-year coaching course, left after one year; refund refused. District Commission ordered Rs 28,000 refund; the State Commission upheld it, fined the institute Rs 25,000 for a frivolous appeal, directed Rs 7,000 as compensation and litigation cost, and restrained institutions from charging entire course fees in advance at one go.",
